  "notes": "{走行|そうこう} refers specifically to the movement of vehicles, not people. It is commonly seen on car dashboards, in driving manuals, and in traffic-related contexts.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {走行|そうこう}{距離|きょり} (mileage, distance traveled)\n- {走行|そうこう}{中|ちゅう} (while driving/in motion)\n- {走行|そうこう}{速度|そくど} (driving speed)\n- {走行|そうこう}{車線|しゃせん} (driving lane)\n- {自動|じどう}{走行|そうこう} (autonomous driving)\n\nWHEN NOT USED:\n{走行|そうこう} is not used for people running on foot. Use {走|はし}る or ランニング for that.",
